            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在色相上延伸的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在饱和度上延伸的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊的柔化半径，单位为像素"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "How much edge noise is hidden while sharpening.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锐化时隐藏多少边缘杂色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差向相邻像素扩散的比例；较低值会产生更平坦的色块"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用多少配置文件扭曲校正。"
          }
