    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用多少配置文件晕影校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the RGB curve also changes color strength. Zero keeps it to brightness.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RGB 曲线同时改变颜色强度的程度。零表示仅改变亮度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整曲线对饱和度的影响。0 与 Photoshop 一致；负值侧重明度，正值增强颜色。"
          }
