        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本框保留标准 macOS 编辑键。对话框共用上面的“应用/取消”快捷键。数字框使用上/下方向键，按住 Shift 步进更大。标准 macOS 命令包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器本身在非录制状态下始终用 Return 存储、Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text · Double-click to edit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字 · 双击编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字编辑快捷键需要 Command、Option 或 Control，以免取代正常输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Texture": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纹理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That selection is too detailed to outline. Try a different Tolerance, or turn on Contiguous.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该选区过于复杂，无法勾勒轮廓。请尝试其他容差，或打开“连续”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That shape is too large. A shape can cover up to %lld megapixels.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该形状过大，最大可覆盖 %lld 百万像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That text box exceeds the %@-pixel or %lld-megapixel limit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文字框超出 %@ 像素边长或 %lld 百万像素限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The 2012 response. Calibration reaches most of the strength used by Version 6.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2012 年的响应，校准可达到版本 6 的大部分强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photoshop file could not be read. It may be damaged or incomplete.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取 Photoshop 文件，它可能已损坏或不完整。"
